one","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"accordion_row_mGKDJ8":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Product detail","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_PgRtGb":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<h5><strong>🖼️ Custom Abstract Pet Canvas – A Modern Masterpiece of Your Beloved Pet<\/strong><\/h5><p>Turn your furry friend’s photo into a <strong>one-of-a-kind piece of art<\/strong> with our <strong>PawUnder™ Abstract Pet Canvas<\/strong>! 🎨<br\/><br\/>Each artwork is digitally hand-drawn in a <strong>vibrant, modern abstract style<\/strong>, capturing your pet’s unique charm and personality in every brushstroke. It’s not just décor – it’s your love, loyalty, and memories brought to life on canvas. 🐾✨<\/p><h5>🌟 <strong>Product Highlights<\/strong><\/h5><ul><li>🎨 <strong>Museum-quality craftsmanship<\/strong> – printed on premium-grade canvas for stunning color and texture.<br\/><\/li><li>🐶 <strong>Fully personalized<\/strong> – each portrait is hand-designed from your pet’s photo, ensuring no two are ever alike.<br\/><\/li><li>🕰️ <strong>Made to last a lifetime<\/strong> – fade-resistant inks with a <strong>100-year color guarantee<\/strong>.<br\/><\/li><li>🖼️ <strong>Ready to hang options<\/strong> –<br\/><br\/><em>Gallery Wrapped Canvas<\/em>: stretched over a solid wooden frame, ready to display.<br\/><br\/><em>Black or White Floating Frame<\/em>: arrives professionally framed and ready to hang out of the box.<br\/><br\/><\/li><li>🌍 <strong>Crafted in the USA & Europe<\/strong>, shipped worldwide with love and care.<br\/><\/li><li>💛 <strong>Exclusively by PawUnder™<\/strong> – no resellers, no mass production. Every portrait is truly yours.<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>Bring warmth, style, and personality into your home — or surprise a fellow pet lover with a meaningful, heartfelt gift that lasts forever. 💕🐾<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_PgRtGb"]},"accordion_row_wJKRGj":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Fully customizable","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_YQPtDg":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Want to make your portrait truly one-of-a-kind? Every PawUnder canvas is fully customizable! You can:<\/p><ul><li>Add your pet’s name or a special phrase<br\/><\/li><li>Request specific colors or style tweaks<br\/><\/li><li>Share inspiration images or art styles you love — we’ll use them as references to match your vision as closely as possible<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>After you add the product to your cart, click <strong>“Add special instructions”<\/strong> and tell us all your personalization details.<\/p><p>Prefer email? Reach out anytime at <a><strong>cs@pawunder.com<\/strong><\/a> with your ideas!<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_YQPtDg"]},"accordion_row_69qbbA":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Shipping & delivery","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_hhKEky":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>At <strong>PawUnder<\/strong>, each canvas is <strong>lovingly crafted and made to order<\/strong> in the <strong>USA<\/strong> 🇺🇸.<br\/><br\/>We take pride in transforming your pet’s photo into a timeless work of art and delivering it safely to your doorstep.<\/p><h5>🕒 <strong>Artwork Creation Time<\/strong><\/h5><p>Your custom artwork begins right after you place your order.<br\/><br\/>We’ll send you a <strong>digital artwork preview via email within 2–3 business days<\/strong> for approval.<br\/><br\/>Once you confirm your design, we’ll move your portrait straight into printing within <strong>24 hours<\/strong> of your approval.<\/p><h5>📦 <strong>Production & Shipping Time<\/strong><\/h5><ul><li><strong>Production Time:<\/strong> 3–5 business days<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Shipping Time (USA):<\/strong> 3–5 business days<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Two-Day Shipping:<\/strong> Available for U.S. customers who want faster delivery 🚀<br\/><\/li><\/ul><h5>🌍 <strong>Estimated Delivery Times<\/strong><\/h5><p>We proudly ship worldwide, with all orders sent fully tracked for your peace of mind. Once your canvas is shipped, you’ll receive an email with your tracking number so you can follow your order every step of the way.<\/p><p><strong>Delivery estimates:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>🇺🇸 <strong>USA:<\/strong> 3–5 business days<br\/><\/li><li>🇬🇧 <strong>UK:<\/strong> 5–7 business days<br\/><\/li><li>🇪🇺 <strong>Europe:<\/strong> 5–7 business days<br\/><\/li><li>🇨🇦 <strong>Canada & 🇦🇺 Australia:<\/strong> 5–8 business days<br\/><\/li><li>🌎 <strong>Rest of World:<\/strong> 8–12 business days<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>Each PawUnder canvas is carefully packaged and shipped with care to ensure it arrives safely and ready to display.<\/p><h5>💌 <strong>Need Help?<\/strong><\/h5><p>If you have any questions about your order or shipping status, our friendly support team is always here to help!<br\/><br\/>📧 <strong>Email:<\/strong> <a>cs@pawunder.com<\/a><\/p><p>✨ Every PawUnder canvas is handcrafted with love, inspected for quality, and shipped with care — because your pet’s story deserves nothing less than perfection. 🐾<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_hhKEky"]},"accordion_row_if8wKK":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Satisfaction guaranted","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_C4qkTq":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<h5>💛 <strong>Our 100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/strong><\/h5><p>At <strong>PawUnder<\/strong>, your happiness is our top priority. We want you to absolutely love your pet’s portrait — from the very first preview to the moment it hangs proudly on your wall. 🐾<\/p><p>Here’s what our <strong>Satisfaction Guarantee<\/strong> includes:<\/p><h5>🎨 <strong>Unlimited Previews & Revisions<\/strong><\/h5><p>We’ll send you up to <strong>three artwork previews<\/strong> of your pet’s portrait within just a few days.<br\/><br\/>You can request <strong>unlimited edits, color adjustments, or even a complete redesign<\/strong> until the artwork perfectly matches your vision.<br\/><br\/>We’ll <strong>only start printing once you confirm<\/strong> that everything looks exactly the way you want.<\/p><h5>🖼️ <strong>Free Replacement for Defects<\/strong><\/h5><p>Every canvas is carefully inspected before shipping, but if your artwork arrives <strong>damaged, misprinted, or defective<\/strong>, we’ll <strong>replace it completely free of charge<\/strong> — no questions asked, no extra cost.<\/p><h5>💌 <strong>Post-Purchase Satisfaction<\/strong><\/h5><p>If, after receiving your canvas, you’re <strong>not 100% satisfied<\/strong> for any reason, we’ll gladly recreate your portrait from scratch within <strong>30 days of delivery<\/strong>.<br\/><br\/>Simply cover the <strong>shipping cost (about 20% of the original price)<\/strong> for your replacement, and we’ll handle the rest — ensuring your new portrait perfectly reflects your pet’s personality and your expectations.<\/p><h5>🌟 <strong>Trusted by Thousands of Pet Lovers<\/strong><\/h5><p>With over <strong>12,000 happy customers<\/strong> and hundreds of <strong>5-star reviews<\/strong>, PawUnder is proud to create meaningful keepsakes that celebrate the love between pets and their humans.<br\/><br\/>Our friendly support team is always here to help with any questions or special requests.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_C4qkTq"]}},"block_order":["accordion_row_mGKDJ8","accordion_row_wJKRGj","accordion_row_69qbbA","accordion_row_if8wKK"]}},"block_order":["group_icgrde","divider_VJhene","custom_liquid_cW4dFN","custom_liquid_9kdVgJ","ai_gen_block_8303218_XkC7NH","variant_picker_R3rGDr","vitals_ub_product_bundles_E96Y4E","buy_buttons_eYQEYi","text_aEtTtq","accordion_tanykP"]}},"settings":{"content_width":"content-center-aligned","desktop_media_position":"left","equal_columns":false,"limit_details_width":false,"gap":48,"enable_sticky_add_to_cart":true,"color_scheme":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"section_9iHqy8":{"type":"section","blocks":{"group_ieXzBF":{"type":"group","name":"t:names.content","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":